 "contents": "FS-2P Mk2 passenger cabin: 24-gon white chamfered panel liner on the smooth IML (20 mm, 8 mm seams) over the dark pressure-vessel liner, panelled fore / aft bulkheads, LED inlays; tiled floor; 2 reclined passenger seats (own build, 50 deg, 1 row: graphite shell, off-white cushions, head pad, armrests, harness, pedestal) with armrest control pads and reading lights; 3 overhead bins (white, graphite doors, latches, LED under-light); aft baggage rack (shelf, lip, tie-down bars); forward floor baggage locker with cargo net; ceiling LED wash; passenger info display; +X upper side hatch (coaming, seal, door trim, handle, valve, hinge fairings) with hatch step and 2 handrails; 6 side windows with tight black bezels and inner panes; extinguisher, first aid",
 "notes": [
  "frame: gravity Godot -Z (aircraft level flight, +Y = nose), confirmed for B9",
  "floor: tiles on the flat IML floor (Godot z -0.42 + panel); the floor band is not panelled",
  "R3: seats moved (y -0.45), SRP +67 mm, hatch moved forward (y 0.8), windows y -0.75 / -0.40 / -0.05: own passenger seats kept (the stock mq00 frame foot ends 13.4 mm below the IML floor, ~48 mm below the floor-tile tops (z -0.385)); aft rack front moved aft to y -1.25 and the floor locker front to y 1.20 (head boxes / new hatch keep-out); overhead bins re-laid (-X: 2 forward; +X: 1 aft of the hatch); hatch step under the new hatch; the window_3 hatch sight clip is no longer needed (>= 0.2 m window-hatch gap)",
  "passenger cabin: overhead bins, aft baggage rack, forward floor locker; ceiling LED wash + 2 reading lights; hatch step + 2 handrails (iva offset 0.545)",
  "windows 1-6: tight bezels opened toward both passenger eyes; bins / rack clipped out of the sight cones",
  "hatch 1: coaming edge chamfer not applied (OCC)"
